  ["re-frame.core" "make-frame"]          {:tier :advanced    :owner "002" :status "EP-0024"
                                          :action :keep
                                          :justification "The ONE programmatic frame constructor over the ONE frames registry (EP-0024); it returns the frame value every other public surface accepts interchangeably with an id. Advanced rather than front-porch because most apps mount through frame-root. RECORDED UNCERTAINTY (scale, not placement): at 687 in-repo consumer files it is the most-referenced name on the facade, so any future move is a consumer break rather than a tidy-up -- which is why it is recorded keep."}
